<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Password Change OTP</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Arial', sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        color: #333;
      }
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        margin: 30px auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 5px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      .header {
        text-align: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #883bbc, #b06cd4);
        color: #ffffff;
        padding: 28px 20px;
        border-radius: 10px 10px 0 0;
      }
      .header h1 {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: 22px;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
      }
      .header p {
        margin: 6px 0 0;
        font-size: 13px;
        opacity: 0.85;
      }
      .content {
        padding: 28px 24px;
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.7;
      }
      .otp-box {
        margin: 24px auto;
        text-align: center;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f3a9de22, #883bbc11);
        border: 2px dashed #883bbc;
        border-radius: 12px;
        padding: 20px;
        width: fit-content;
        min-width: 200px;
      }
      .otp-box .label {
        font-size: 12px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        color: #883bbc;
        font-weight: bold;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .otp-code {
        font-size: 42px;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 10px;
        color: #883bbc;
        font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
      }
      .expiry-note {
        background-color: #fff8e1;
        border-left: 4px solid #f3a9de;
        padding: 10px 14px;
        border-radius: 4px;
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #555;
        margin: 16px 0;
      }
      .warning {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #888;
        margin-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #eee;
        padding-top: 14px;
      }
      .footer {
        margin-top: 10px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #aaa;
        padding: 12px;
      }
      .brand {
        font-size: 18px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #883bbc;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="header">
        <h1>Password Change Request</h1>
        <p>GatiVidhi — Your Work Progress Tracker</p>
      </div>

      <div class="content">
        <p>Hi <strong><%= user.name %></strong>,</p>

        <p>We received a request to change the password for your GatiVidhi account. Use the OTP below to confirm and proceed:</p>

        <div class="otp-box">
          <div class="label">Your One-Time Password</div>
          <div class="otp-code"><%= user.otp %></div>
        </div>

        <div class="expiry-note">
          This OTP is valid for <strong>10 minutes</strong> only. Do not share it with anyone.
        </div>

        <p>If you did not request a password change, please ignore this email. Your account remains secure.</p>

        <div class="warning">
          This is an automated message. Please do not reply to this email.
        </div>

        <p style="margin-top:20px;">Warm regards,<br /><span class="brand">Team GatiVidhi</span><br /><em>Transforming spaces. Creating stories.</em></p>
      </div>

      <div class="footer">
        &copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> GatiVidhi. All rights reserved.
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
